 "statement": {
  "status": "present",
  "value": "ChatEventAggregator(m) with m >= 1. recordEvent(timestamp, userId, chatId) stores one event. getUserCount(timestamp, userId) returns the number of that user's events with time in [timestamp - m + 1, timestamp]. All calls have non-decreasing timestamps (inference) and each user's events strictly increase in time. History outside every future window may be discarded.",
